                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>The professional internship for Basic Medicine majors is designed to apply theories of medical biology, basic medical sciences and clinical medicine to scientific research on the basis of previous studies. Through systematic training in scientific thinking and practice, students will master basic research methods and cultivate innovation, independent learning, teamwork and practical abilities, so as to lay a solid foundation for future scientific research.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
